     integrated negative-part consumer;
   * a concrete two-point instance discharging every parameter.

3. `DASHI/Physics/YangMills/BalabanCMP109LiteralOneLoopBoxNearFarOptimisationExact.agda`

   The near region is taken to be a **coordinate box** of half-width `r`, so its
   measure is the exact product `r⁴` and the far measure is `1/16 − r⁴`: the
